  (text "J1 / U4: the CH224A asks a PD brick for 20 V (R24 120k on CFG1); below 20 V the CN3704 cannot reach 16.8 V and nothing charges.  U5: buck at" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 353.06 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d42c5532-8815-562b-990a-587a1b4db46a"))
  (text "300 kHz, Q6 switch, D7 blocks the pack from the input through Q6's body diode, D8 freewheels, L1 22 uH, R25 + R26 = 0.2 R -> 1 A constant current," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 353.06 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e2565c5d-8aab-5af4-a2f7-377dc3b75908"))
  (text "16.8 V +-1 % constant voltage, termination at 9 % (92 mA), trickle at 150 mA below 11.2 V, re-charge below 16.0 V, over-voltage cut at 18.1 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 353.06 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39de347d-f667-51df-886b-ba584bda5e47"))
  (text "RT1 10k NTC between the cells stops charging hot / cold (10k fixed resistor disables it).  D9 CHRG (red), D10 DONE (green).  CGND meets GND only" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 353.06 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a97e62d-91f3-5998-aa52-38733396ee5a"))
  (text "in the CHARGE position (SW1 pole 2); R30 1M keeps it defined otherwise, so a brick plugged in while running does nothing.  20 uA from the pack idle." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 353.06 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4108d70f-d81f-5105-b39e-38fe595fd84a"))
